  "custom_logic_notes": "The EA implements a fuzzy inference system (FIS) with triangular/trapezoidal membership functions applied to standard indicator values. The fuzzy logic layer aggregates multiple indicator signals using fuzzy AND/OR operators (min/max or weighted average) to produce a composite buy/sell score. A defuzzification step converts the aggregated fuzzy output to a crisp trading signal when it exceeds a threshold. This custom fuzzy engine is the core differentiator and must be reimplemented in Python, typically using a library like skfuzzy or a hand-rolled membership function + rule evaluation system.",
