  "python_conversion_notes": "The fuzzy inference engine must be reimplemented from scratch. Key steps: 1) Define triangular/trapezoidal membership functions for each indicator input (MA difference, RSI value, MACD histogram). 2) Implement rule evaluation using fuzzy AND (min) and OR (max) operators. 3) Implement defuzzification (centroid or mean-of-maxima) to produce crisp buy/sell scores. 4) Apply threshold to generate trade signals. Consider using scikit-fuzzy (skfuzzy) library for the FIS. The underlying indicators (EMA, RSI, MACD) are straightforward with pandas-ta or ta-lib. Pay close attention to membership function parameters (a, b, c for triangular; a, b, c, d for trapezoidal) which may be hardcoded or derived from inputs in the source.",
